              "settings": {
                "tabs": [
                  {
                    "tab_title": "01  —  Psycho-Energetic Training",
                    "tab_content": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4a853;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(212,168,83,0.3);border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;\">SAMPO System</span></p><p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(13,17,23,0.7);max-width:500px;margin-bottom:24px;\">A complete system for accumulating, protecting and directing your vital energy. Ancient Siberian methods to shield from external influences and awaken your dormant life force.</p><a href=\"https://calendly.com/hurraymangalam/individualsessions\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#050505;background:#d4a853;padding:16px 40px;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;\">Book Session →</a>"
                  },
                  {
                    "tab_title": "02  —  Sacred Drum Healing",
                    "tab_content": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4a853;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(212,168,83,0.3);border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;\">Sound Medicine</span></p><p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(13,17,23,0.7);max-width:500px;margin-bottom:24px;\">The shaman's drum is a portal. Its frequencies shift brainwave states instantly, dissolve trauma held in the cellular body, and initiate spontaneous healing responses.</p><a href=\"https://calendly.com/hurraymangalam/individualsessions\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#050505;background:#d4a853;padding:16px 40px;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;\">Book Session →</a>"
                  },
                  {
                    "tab_title": "03  —  1-on-1 Shamanic Session",
                    "tab_content": "<p style=\"margin-bottom:8px;\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#d4a853;padding:4px 12px;border:1px solid rgba(212,168,83,0.3);border-radius:4px;display:inline-block;\">Personal Healing</span></p><p style=\"font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;color:rgba(13,17,23,0.7);max-width:500px;margin-bottom:24px;\">Direct, private energetic work with Shaman Abhay Oyun. Each session identifies the root cause of imbalance — physical, emotional, or ancestral — and applies targeted shamanic intervention.</p><a href=\"https://calendly.com/hurraymangalam/individualsessions\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:1.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#050505;background:#d4a853;padding:16px 40px;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;\">Book Session →</a>"
